[{"id":3968305148,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7sh4f8","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117432#pullrequestreview-3968305148","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117432","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-03-18T14:35:46Z"},{"id":3968398830,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7siPXu","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","login":"TokageItLab","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab"},"body":"I think the scrollable feature is a good idea. If I have any concerns, it’s about the order of the error stack. If the order is guaranteed by oldest top - latest bottom sorting, I believe the scroll position should be set to the bottom whenever a new entry is added. However, I expect the order is not guaranteed (I assume animation tree's error stack is different to the regular process), so I think we can leave the scroll position as is for now.\r\n\r\nThe requested change here is that the error container must not be fully hidden. If there is an error, the container must retain at least one line of height; if not, it will be impossible to tell if there is an error when user shrink it to 0 height. Would simply setting the minimum_height resolve this?","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117432#pullrequestreview-3968398830","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117432","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-03-18T14:47:10Z"},{"id":3969731375,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7snUsv","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117432#pullrequestreview-3969731375","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117432","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-03-18T17:46:26Z"},{"id":4025995096,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7v989Y","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","login":"TokageItLab","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab"},"body":"I believe an error icon alone isn’t enough for users to notice the error. If a toast notification is displayed, it might be acceptable, but unless a toast notification is shown, it should use a column layout like the one below and display at least one line of text.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1009\" height=\"145\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/06103f17-77ae-407b-8d0e-8aee5fdadbe0\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"982\" height=\"210\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d016a9d-7d03-43da-a4a2-e3cc12a4fc31\" />\r\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117432#pullrequestreview-4025995096","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117432","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-03-28T20:31:43Z"},{"id":4110742033,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc71BPIR","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"ee520f53066597f153bb6158c080800f7d9b3c7c","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","login":"TokageItLab","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab"},"body":"For now, I’ve confirmed that at least one line error message is displayed and that the situation won’t get any worse than it is now. I recommend merging this into 4.7.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117432#pullrequestreview-4110742033","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117432","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-04-15T04:28:35Z"}]